  {
   "id": "examples-imports-md-7",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "## Sharing code today\n\nPut helper functions in the same file, or do the work in a polyglot block. The\nonly cross-file mechanism that exists is outside the language: run several\nprograms and pass data through files or the host.\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "done"
   },
